  "notes": "Datasheet title and primary PN LS-BL293025-60C: Tx 1295 nm / Rx 1309 nm BIDI; ordering LS-BL293025-60C is 0°C to 70°C commercial. Link up to 40 km SMF without FEC; up to 60 km with FEC (FEC type not specified). Receiver sensitivity (OMA): -19 dBm at 40 km NO FEC; -21 dBm at 60 km with FEC. Optical tables also list wavelength ranges for LS-BL302925-60x (reverse Tx/Rx wavelengths). Industrial variants LS-BL293025-60I: -40°C to 85°C, power <1.8 W, ICC max 540 mA. Transmitter OMA (POMA) 2 to 6 dBm; average output power (laser off) POFF max -30 dBm. TDP (transmitter and dispersion penalty) max 2.7 dB. Spectrum bandwidth @ -20 dB max 1 nm.",
